    value: "CMR-V1 source-level reproducibility: INCOMPLETE / DISCLOSED"
    description: "The prospectively frozen cross-mechanism study CMR-V1 is a supplementary negative replication (terminal decision CMR-D, protocol stop, X3-X5 never run). Artefact internal consistency, CPU-CUDA numerical parity and decision-level determinism all pass; source-level reproducibility is INCOMPLETE / DISCLOSED because the two source files that produced the frozen extraction run are not present at their recorded hashes. This limitation is confined to CMR-V1 and does not apply to the Phase 0-5 evidence chain."
